An aging Texas cattle man who has outlived his time swings
into action when outlaws kidnap his grandson.

4
00:29:20,000 --> 00:29:26,000
Jacob McCandles, played by John Wayne.

5
00:36:40,000 --> 00:36:46,000
John Fain, played by Richard Boone.

6
00:44:00,000 --> 00:44:06,000
Martha McCandles, played by Maureen O'Hara.

7
00:51:20,000 --> 00:51:26,000
James McCandles, played by Patrick Wayne.

8
00:58:40,000 --> 00:58:46,000
