9
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
Jeff McCandles, played by Bobby Vinton.

10
01:13:20,000 --> 01:13:26,000
Big Jake is a 1971 American Technicolor Western film starring
John Wayne, Richard Boone and Maureen O'Hara.

11
01:20:40,000 --> 01:20:46,000
The picture was the final film for George Sherman in a directing career of more than 30 years, and
Maureen O'Hara's last film with John Wayne and her last before her twenty-year retirement.

12
01:28:00,000 --> 01:28:06,000
The supporting cast features Patrick Wayne, Christopher Mitchum,
Glenn Corbett, Jim Davis, John Agar, Harry Carey Jr.

13
01:35:20,000 --> 01:35:26,000
and Hank Worden.

14
01:42:40,000 --> 01:42:46,000
The film explores themes of kidnapping, texas, ranch, cigar smoking.
